.SS "int sc_MPI_Error_class (int errorcode, int * errorclass)"

.PP
Turn an MPI error code into its error class\&. When MPI is enabled, we pass version 1\&.1 errors to MPI_Error_class\&. When MPI I/O is not enabled, we process file errors outside of MPI\&. Thus, within libsc, it is always legal to call this function with any errorcode defined above in this header file\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIerrorcode\fP Returned from a direct MPI call or libsc\&. 
.br
\fIerrorclass\fP Non-NULL pointer\&. Filled with matching error class on success\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
sc_MPI_SUCCESS on successful conversion, Other MPI error code otherwise\&. 
.RE
.PP

